{"id":"3953b8fffc6e6551","group":"90","path":"90/90-df-configuration.md","title":"Turing Machine Configuration","display":"df-configuration — Turing Machine Configuration","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-df-configuration","aliases":["90-df-configuration"],"display":"df-configuration — Turing Machine Configuration","depends_on":["[[90-df-turing-machine]]","[[90-df-subtraction-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-df-configuration"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-df-configuration</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-configuration — Turing Machine Configuration"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"82c921b871f2639b\" href=\"?note=82c921b871f2639b\" title=\"90-df-turing-machine\">90-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1e6602d1acf4aceb\" href=\"?note=1e6602d1acf4aceb\" title=\"90-df-subtraction-function\">90-df-subtraction-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-configuration-—-Configuration-($\\mathrm{Conf}$)\">df-configuration — Configuration (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conf}\">\\(\\mathrm{Conf}\\)</span>)</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_M,\\Gamma_M,B_M,q_{0,M},q_{\\mathrm{acc},M},q_{\\mathrm{rej},M},\\delta_M\">\\(Q_M,\\Gamma_M,B_M,q_{0,M},q_{\\mathrm{acc},M},q_{\\mathrm{rej},M},\\delta_M\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"82c921b871f2639b\" href=\"?note=82c921b871f2639b\" title=\"90-df-turing-machine\">90-df-turing-machine</a> 的机器分量。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本书保持半无限纸带约定：位置属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\">\\(\\mathbb N\\)</span>，不是本地通用机器运行接口采用的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\mathbb Z\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c,c&#39;\">\\(c,c&#39;\\)</span> 为候选配置；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L,R\">\\(L,R\\)</span> 是机器方向符号。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_{\\mathrm{start}}^M,q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M,q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^M\">\\(q_{\\mathrm{start}}^M,q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M,q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^M\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"82c921b871f2639b\" href=\"?note=82c921b871f2639b\" title=\"90-df-turing-machine\">90-df-turing-machine</a> 的原投影；下式明确给出本书调用的三个别名。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conf}\">\\(\\mathrm{Conf}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pred}\">\\(\\operatorname{pred}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1e6602d1acf4aceb\" href=\"?note=1e6602d1acf4aceb\" title=\"90-df-subtraction-function\">90-df-subtraction-function</a>，用于半无限纸带的左端边界。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"q_{0,M}\\coloneqq q_{\\mathrm{start}}^M,\\qquad\nq_{\\mathrm{acc},M}\\coloneqq q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M,\\qquad\nq_{\\mathrm{rej},M}\\coloneqq q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^M.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[q_{0,M}\\coloneqq q_{\\mathrm{start}}^M,\\qquad\nq_{\\mathrm{acc},M}\\coloneqq q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M,\\qquad\nq_{\\mathrm{rej},M}\\coloneqq q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^M.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal B_M&amp;\\coloneqq B_M,\\\\\n\\mathcal T_M&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\tau\\in\\Gamma_M^{\\mathbb N}:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall j\\in\\mathbb N\\\n(j\\ge n\\Longrightarrow\\tau(j)=B_M)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Conf}_M&amp;\\coloneqq Q_M\\times\\mathcal T_M\\times\\mathbb N.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal B_M&amp;\\coloneqq B_M,\\\\\n\\mathcal T_M&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\tau\\in\\Gamma_M^{\\mathbb N}:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall j\\in\\mathbb N\\\n(j\\ge n\\Longrightarrow\\tau(j)=B_M)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Conf}_M&amp;\\coloneqq Q_M\\times\\mathcal T_M\\times\\mathbb N.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Step}_M(c,c&#39;)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&amp;c,c&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_M\\land\n\\exists q,q&#39;\\in Q_M\\ \\exists\\tau,\\tau&#39;\\in\\mathcal T_M\\ \\exists h,h&#39;\\in\\mathbb N\\\n\\exists a\\in\\Gamma_M\\ \\exists D\\in\\{L,R\\}\\ \\bigl[\\\\\n&amp;c=(q,\\tau,h)\\land c&#39;=(q&#39;,\\tau&#39;,h&#39;)\n\\land q\\notin\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc},M},q_{\\mathrm{rej},M}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\delta_M(q,\\tau(h))=(q&#39;,a,D)\n\\land\\tau&#39;(h)=a\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb N\\ (j\\ne h\\Longrightarrow\\tau&#39;(j)=\\tau(j))\\\\\n&amp;\\land((D=R\\land h&#39;=h+1)\\lor(D=L\\land h&#39;=\\operatorname{pred}(h)))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Step}_M(c,c&#39;)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&amp;c,c&#39;\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_M\\land\n\\exists q,q&#39;\\in Q_M\\ \\exists\\tau,\\tau&#39;\\in\\mathcal T_M\\ \\exists h,h&#39;\\in\\mathbb N\\\n\\exists a\\in\\Gamma_M\\ \\exists D\\in\\{L,R\\}\\ \\bigl[\\\\\n&amp;c=(q,\\tau,h)\\land c&#39;=(q&#39;,\\tau&#39;,h&#39;)\n\\land q\\notin\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc},M},q_{\\mathrm{rej},M}\\}\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\delta_M(q,\\tau(h))=(q&#39;,a,D)\n\\land\\tau&#39;(h)=a\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb N\\ (j\\ne h\\Longrightarrow\\tau&#39;(j)=\\tau(j))\\\\\n&amp;\\land((D=R\\land h&#39;=h+1)\\lor(D=L\\land h&#39;=\\operatorname{pred}(h)))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Conf}_M\">\\(\\mathrm{Conf}_M\\)</span> 为配置集合、纸带有限支撑及自然数头位置。新增的边界规则明确左移至位置零后保持在零；停机状态没有下一步。双向纸带配置与步关系不能不经翻译直接代入本文件的半无限版本。本书编码层在 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"01ab533da9c8c517\" href=\"?note=01ab533da9c8c517\" title=\"90-df-machine-coding\">90-df-machine-coding</a> 中另行定义，配置对象不等于配置代码。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_M\">\\(\\mathcal T_M\\)</span> 保持原纸带集合名称；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tape}_M(c)\">\\(\\mathrm{Tape}_M(c)\\)</span> 仍专用于 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ea8ec37142a5e9b6\" href=\"?note=ea8ec37142a5e9b6\" title=\"90-df-conf-proj\">90-df-conf-proj</a> 的纸带投影，不用同名词同时表示集合与投影函数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-configuration-—-Configuration-($\\mathrm{Conf}$)","text":"df-configuration — Configuration ($\\mathrm{Conf}$)","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"90-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"82c921b871f2639b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-subtraction-function","status":"resolved","id":"1e6602d1acf4aceb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-subtraction-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"82c921b871f2639b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$ 及 $Q_M,\\Gamma_M,B_M,q_{0,M},q_{\\mathrm{acc},M},q_{\\mathrm{rej},M},\\delta_M$ 取 [[90-df-turing-machine]] 的机器分量。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"82c921b871f2639b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$q_{\\mathrm{start}}^M,q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M,q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^M$ 是 [[90-df-turing-machine]] 的原投影；下式明确给出本书调用的三个别名。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-subtraction-function","status":"resolved","id":"1e6602d1acf4aceb","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{pred}$ 取 [[90-df-subtraction-function]]，用于半无限纸带的左端边界。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-machine-coding","status":"resolved","id":"01ab533da9c8c517","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"保留 $\\mathrm{Conf}_M$ 为配置集合、纸带有限支撑及自然数头位置。新增的边界规则明确左移至位置零后保持在零；停机状态没有下一步。双向纸带配置与步关系不能不经翻译直接代入本文件的半无限版本。本书编码层在 [[90-df-machine-coding]] 中另行定义，配置对象不等于配置代码。","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-conf-proj","status":"resolved","id":"ea8ec37142a5e9b6","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal T_M$ 保持原纸带集合名称；$\\mathrm{Tape}_M(c)$ 仍专用于 [[90-df-conf-proj]] 的纸带投影，不用同名词同时表示集合与投影函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conf}","display":false},{"tex":"M\\in\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"Q_M,\\Gamma_M,B_M,q_{0,M},q_{\\mathrm{acc},M},q_{\\mathrm{rej},M},\\delta_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb Z","display":false},{"tex":"c,c'","display":false},{"tex":"L,R","display":false},{"tex":"q_{\\mathrm{start}}^M,q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M,q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conf}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{pred}","display":false},{"tex":"q_{0,M}\\coloneqq q_{\\mathrm{start}}^M,\\qquad\nq_{\\mathrm{acc},M}\\coloneqq q_{\\mathrm{accept}}^M,\\qquad\nq_{\\mathrm{rej},M}\\coloneqq q_{\\mathrm{reject}}^M.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathcal B_M&\\coloneqq B_M,\\\\\n\\mathcal T_M&\\coloneqq\\{\\tau\\in\\Gamma_M^{\\mathbb N}:\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\forall j\\in\\mathbb N\\\n(j\\ge n\\Longrightarrow\\tau(j)=B_M)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Conf}_M&\\coloneqq Q_M\\times\\mathcal T_M\\times\\mathbb N.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Step}_M(c,c')\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n&c,c'\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_M\\land\n\\exists q,q'\\in Q_M\\ \\exists\\tau,\\tau'\\in\\mathcal T_M\\ \\exists h,h'\\in\\mathbb N\\\n\\exists a\\in\\Gamma_M\\ \\exists D\\in\\{L,R\\}\\ \\bigl[\\\\\n&c=(q,\\tau,h)\\land c'=(q',\\tau',h')\n\\land q\\notin\\{q_{\\mathrm{acc},M},q_{\\mathrm{rej},M}\\}\\\\\n&\\land\\delta_M(q,\\tau(h))=(q',a,D)\n\\land\\tau'(h)=a\\land\\forall j\\in\\mathbb N\\ (j\\ne h\\Longrightarrow\\tau'(j)=\\tau(j))\\\\\n&\\land((D=R\\land h'=h+1)\\lor(D=L\\land h'=\\operatorname{pred}(h)))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Conf}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tape}_M(c)","display":false}],"bytes":2705,"backlinks":[{"id":"61f71a91e63627ba","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M_e,\\operatorname{CCode},\\operatorname{EncConf},\\operatorname{Init},\\operatorname{CStep}$ 全部取 [[90-df-machine-coding]]；配置对象见 [[90-df-configuration]]。"},{"id":"ea8ec37142a5e9b6","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$ and $(q,\\tau,i)\\in\\mathrm{Conf}_M$ (machine and configuration, see [[90-df-configuration]])"},{"id":"4a2564848c03103c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"01ab533da9c8c517","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Conf}_M$、$\\operatorname{Step}_M$ 取 [[90-df-configuration]]，机器元组与方向符号 $L,R$ 取 [[90-df-turing-machine]]。$\\vec x\\in\\mathbb N^{<\\omega}$，$w\\in\\{0,1\\}^{<\\omega}$；输入词使用 [[90-df-encoding]] 的 $\\operatorname{wordenc}$。"},{"id":"82c921b871f